    <string name="dsh_plugin_repair">Rebuild plugin dependencies</string>
    <string name="dsh_plugin_repair_summary">Without real hardlink support, pnpm\'s links point into its content store, so a plugin\'s client bundle cannot be found and the service fails to start. Rebuilding wipes node_modules and reinstalls with real file copies (keeps pnpm-lock.yaml; may take a few minutes, and the service cannot start while it runs). If you set packageImportMethod yourself in the profile\'s pnpm-workspace.yaml, that setting is kept and this may not help.</string>
